  title="We measured 18 modern web features on 600 real sites. :has() is at 50%, dialog at 3.8%"
  description="Support is documented everywhere. Actual use is not. We fetched the home pages of the Tranco top 600, read the served HTML and CSS, and counted what is really there - with the full method, the raw CSV, and the limits."
